    gmeow:stepTypeStart      a gmeow:StepType .
    gmeow:stepTypeEnd        a gmeow:StepType .
    gmeow:stepTypeBranch     a gmeow:StepType .
    gmeow:stepTypeSubprocess a gmeow:StepType .
    gmeow:stepTypeParallel   a gmeow:StepType .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "All six StepType seed individuals MUST be typed gmeow:StepType — step kinds are an open value vocabulary of individuals, never subclasses (Principle 9). Mirrors test_step_type_values_are_individuals (must arm)." .

