    gmeow:saRationale "All six ExecutionStatus seed individuals MUST be typed gmeow:ExecutionStatus — execution status values are an open individual vocabulary, never subclasses (Principle 9). Mirrors test_execution_status_values_are_individuals (must arm)." .

